\newlabel{tab:strict-invalid-rates-all-methods}{{11}{15}{Strict-format invalid rates (\%) by model scale, task, method, and inference interface. Each cell reports DS/RF. Values are one minus the mean strict format-valid rate over seeds 42--44. PaIR-BP is omitted because it was run only at 4B, where its invalid rate is 0.00\% for every task and interface}{table.caption.26}{}}
