\newlabel{tab:full-method-task-level-relaxed}{{13}{16}{Task-level relaxed-parsing primary results for Qwen3-4B and Qwen3-0.6B, recomputed from the same model outputs as Table~\ref {tab:full-method-task-level}. Values are mean $\pm $ sample SD across seeds 42--44; cross-task means use unrounded values. Mean cells report QWK/Macro-F1. For QWK, residual invalid outputs are excluded; Macro-F1 retains the full test set and counts residual invalid outputs as errors. $^{\dagger }$The ReaSon--DS QWK mean at 0.6B is unavailable because Actionability has no defined QWK after relaxed extraction}{table.caption.28}{}}
