\newlabel{tab:full-correction-aggregate}{{18}{19}{Aggregate fixed-prefix intervention on the frozen 158-case set. FixOrig and FixCorr fix the original and corrected rationale, respectively; all 474 outputs are format-valid}{table.caption.33}{}}
